{100}{}{Jtraider}
{200}{}{You see a raider who seems crazed.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Raider34]}
{2000}{}{You just cost this whore her life!}
{2010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> RaiderSnap]}
{3000}{}{That's it! Don't come any closer. I'll off her. I swear.}
{3010}{}{Nung!}
{3020}{}{Don't do it!}
{3030}{}{If you don't let her go, I'm gonna kill you.}
{3040}{}{There is no need for violence. Let's talk about this.}
{4000}{}{What? You just want to kill me, don't you? Just remember, this is your fault.}
{4010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> RaiderSnap]}
{5000}{}{Any why not? She's just a whore.}
{5010}{}{She has as much right to live as you do.}
{6000}{}{No. No way. Not this bitch.}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Oh, big man. Let's see you try. But first . . .
