Oh, big woman. Let's see you try. But first . . .}
{7010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> RaiderSnap]}
{8000}{}{What world do you live in? Out here in the real world, blood flows, man. Blood flows,
and it's gonna spill all over this room if you don't get out of here.}
{8010}{}{We can talk this over. What can I do to help?}
{8020}{}{Ok, ok. I'm backing off. You don't have to worry about me.}
{9000}{}{Geez, that's funny. Who says I want help?}
{9010}{}{You do. By holding this woman hostage, you're asking for help. I can help.}
{10000}{}{I gotta think about this. Give me a moment.}
{10010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{11000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'UpReact']}
{11010}{}{[Done.]}
{12000}{}{Yeah. Don't try anything, or she gets it.}
{12010}{}{[Done.]}
{13000}{}{Just leave me alone. I hate you! You are the devil. I won't listen to you.}
{13010}{}{Have it your way.}
{13020}{}{You have to hear me out. Your life, and the life of the girl, depend on it.}
{13030}{}{Just relax. I won't harm you. I just want to listen to what you have to say.}
{14000}{}{There you go again, threatening me. Die!!}
{14010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> RaiderSnap]}
{15000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Raider17b']}
{15010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Raider20]}
{15020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Raider19]}
{16000}{}{You might have a point. Prove it to me.}
{16010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{17000}{}{I won't listen to you. You're just going to trick me with your words. I don't believe
you. Go away.}
{17010}{}{[Done.]}
{18000}{}{Stay back . . . I don't want to hurt her, but I will.}
{18010}{}{Don't, or I'll have to hurt you.}
{18020}{}{Why do you want to hurt her?}
{19000}{}{Try it, and she dies first. Now, what were you saying?}
{19010}{}{It'll be hard to hurt her with that hole in your head.}
{19020}{}{Ok, but you got to keep talking to me.}
{20000}{}{What hole?}
{20010}{}{The one I'm gonna put there right now.}
{21000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Raider10a']}
{21010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Raider12]}
{21020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Raider13]}
{22000}{}{I'll keep talking as long as you do, but try anything tricky, and she'll take the fall.}
{22010}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{I don't have to do anything. You got to do it, and you ain't doing so hot.}
{23010}{}{[Done.]}
{24000}{}{She laughed at me. They all laughed at me. I'll make 'em pay, I swear.}
{24010}{}{I trust you. Let's work through this, ok?}
{25000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Raider14a']}
{25010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Raider16]}
{25020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Raider15]}
{26000}{}{You sound like an all right kind of guy. No one ever wanted to help me before. I think
we can talk some more.
