{29000}{}{I want some money, and I want to get out of here peacefully. No one follows me.}
{29010}{}{Sorry, we can't do that.}
{29020}{}{Sure.}
{29030}{}{No money, but you can just walk away. No one will do anything. I promise.}
{29040}{}{Ok, but you have to let the girl go first. Show me some trust, and I'll trust you.}
